5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Let us begin calmly. I believe we should prioritize observing each other's patterns before making any hasty accusations.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! Do you think the werewolf is someone we know well? I'll try to guess by looking at everyone's faces!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Intuition is fine, Rin, but we need a logical framework. We should focus on who is trying too hard to blend in.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Mizuki, but let's try to keep things friendly. We'll find the answer if we all cooperate and stay kind.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't see why we're being so cautious. If someone looks suspicious, we should just call them out right away!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Boldness can be a mask, Takumi. A quiet approach often reveals more than a loud one.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, you sound really confident! Are you a brave villager or are you hiding something?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, I agree. The way people react to pressure in the first few turns usually tells us the most.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,Let's not start accusing each other so early. It might create unnecessary tension among us.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm just saying we shouldn't waste time! I'm not hiding anything, I'm just ready to win.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Trust is a fragile thing in this game. We must build it on evidence, not just feelings.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,But feelings are important too! I want to know who feels the most nervous right now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"We should establish a system for sharing information. If anyone has a special role, how should they reveal it?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,Maybe we can wait and see who the Seer feels comfortable trusting first? That seems safer.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Who cares about a system? Just tell us what you know when you know it!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we have a general understanding. I will observe carefully tonight.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
