38,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"That is a very direct claim for the first day. @Jonathan, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock. Are you sure there isn't a mistake, Jonathan?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Takumi,,What?! That's a total lie! You're just trying to frame me because I'm the loudest!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
