49,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I don't like the idea of executing someone so quickly, but the evidence seems strong.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Takumi,,You're all just following him! Don't be so gullible! I'm a villager!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
